<a name="toc_tc77727"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4608: Verify user should be able to add monitoring devices from device listing screen&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 3]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify user should be able to add monitoring devices from device listing screen</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>USer is logged into mobile app and is on device listing screen</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Verify&nbsp;&quot;+&quot; button available to initiate the action on the device listing screen</p>
</td><td><p>&quot;+&quot; ion is displayed</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Verify user click on + icon&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Add monitoring device header should be displayed with Create and cancel button&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Verify the field in step1 Add device tab</p>
</td><td><p>Add device tab should be hoghlighted with below input fields</p>

<ul>
	<li>Device Name *</li>
	<li>Device Type *
	<ul>
		<li>CordProtect</li>
		<li>LoadSense</li>
		<li>MultiProtect</li>
		<li>Other</li>
		<li>RipProtect</li>
		<li>SurfaceProtect</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>Brand</li>
	<li>Serial Number</li>
	<li>Firmware Version</li>
	<li>Remote Connection</li>
	<li>Installation Date</li>
	<li>Commissioning Date</li>
	<li>Last Service Date</li>
	<li>Access to System Software</li>
	<li>Belt / Conveyor Saves</li>
	<li>Status *
	<ul>
		<li>Running</li>
		<li>Not in Operation</li>
		<li>Prior to Commissioning</li>
		<li>Manufacturing</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>Comments</li>
</ul>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td><p>Verify user enter all the fields in step 1 click on next button</p>
</td><td><p>Step 2: &quot;Add Location&quot; tab selected with below fields</p>

<ul>
	<li>Associated Distributor</li>
	<li>Site *</li>
	<li>Conveyor *</li>
	<li>Time Zone *</li>
	<li>Latitude</li>
	<li>Longitude</li>
</ul>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td><p>Verify default time zone dropdown</p>
</td><td><p>local device timezone should be default and user is allowed to change the drop down</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td><p>Verify user enter all the values in step 2 and click on cancel</p>
</td><td><p>Monitoring device is not created and redirected to device listing page</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td><p>Verify user click on + icon and enter all the details in step and step2 and click on create button</p>
</td><td><p>Monitoring Device should be created</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td><p>Verify all the drop down fields&nbsp;search field in dropdown is removed&nbsp;</p>

<p>Drop dwon fields are</p>

<p>1. Device type</p>

<p>2. Remote Connection</p>

<p>3.Status</p>

<p>4. Associated distributor</p>

<p>5. Site</p>

<p>6. Conveyor</p>
</td><td><p>search field in dropdown should removed&nbsp;if dropdown list is not scrollable.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">9</td><td><p>Verify user search for the newly created device</p>
</td><td><p>Newly created device should be displayed when searched</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" >Ready for Automation</td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">CTCP-14290:  Monitoring Device Add and Edit [Version : 1]<br />CTCP-15199:  [Monitoring device] Mobile: Adding new field TimeZone [Version : 1]<br />CTCP-17015:  Remove Search in dropdown if list is not scrollable [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
