<a name="toc_tc77766"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4612: Verify user should be able to edit the monitoring device that was added&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 3]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify user should be able to edit the monitoring device that was added</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>USer is on mobile device listing page&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Verify user select a new monitoring device that has all the fields entered</p>
</td><td><p>Monitoring device should be selected</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Verify edit option is available under 3dots</p>
</td><td><p>Edit option should be displayed</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Verify user select the edit option</p>
</td><td><p>Edit monitoring Device header is displayed</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td><p>Verify user should be able to edit all the fields except the serial number</p>

<p>Note:<strong> Change the status&nbsp; from running to not in operation</strong></p>
</td><td><p>All the fields should be editable except the serial number</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td><p>Verify user click on next</p>
</td><td><p>Add location page is dislpayed</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td><p>Verify user update the site, conveyor,Time zone and location of the device</p>
</td><td><p>site, conveyor, Time zone and location should be edited</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td><p>Verify all the drop down fields&nbsp;search field in dropdown is removed in edit mode&nbsp;</p>

<p>Drop dwon fields are</p>

<p>1. Device type</p>

<p>2. Remote Connection</p>

<p>3.Status</p>

<p>4. Associated distributor</p>

<p>5. Site</p>

<p>6. Conveyor</p>
</td><td><p>If dropdown is not scrollable, remove the search field from the drop dwon</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td><p>Verify user is able to see save and cancel button</p>
</td><td><p>save and cancel button should be displayed</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">9</td><td><p>Verify user click on save</p>
</td><td><p>Data should be updated successfully</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">10</td><td><p>Verify user view the updated monitoring device</p>
</td><td><p>All the fields(if edited)&nbsp;should see updated data</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">11</td><td><p>Verify the main card count and status count</p>
</td><td><p>Main card&nbsp; count remains the same</p>

<p>the status count of running - decremented by one</p>

<p>the status count of not in operation - incremented by one</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" >Ready for Automation</td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
