<a name="toc_tc77802"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4616: Verify the functionality when Manufacturing Status is selected from the drop down&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify the functionality when Manufacturing Status is selected from the drop down</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>User logged in as Master/CCM/KeyUser and&nbsp;is on monitoring device listing page</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Verify user click on the Add icon from MD listing screen as master/CCM/Key user</p>
</td><td><p>Add Device page should be displayed</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Verify user enter the device name,&nbsp;device type and status (mandatory fields)</p>
</td><td><p>Device name, type and status should be entered and selected.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Verify status drop down should be mandatory</p>
</td><td><p>Status drop down should be mandatory i.e asterisk should be displayed</p>
