</td><td><p>&ldquo;Site&rdquo; and &ldquo;Conveyor&rdquo; fields are greyed out (not clickable).</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td><p>Verify User click on Create in Step 2 without entering location</p>
</td><td><p>Monitoring device should be created</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td><p>Verify the created device is displayed on the listing screen</p>
</td><td><p>Device is displayed on the listing screen with status as Manufacturing in Yellow under status column</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td><p>Verify the Yellow flag is displayed on the Main card</p>
</td><td><p>Yellow flag with total Yellow count(manufacturing) should be displayed for master, CCM and Key user</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">9</td><td><p>Verify user click on folder icon for the device with Manufacturing status</p>
</td><td><p>User should not be redirected to file manger i.e&nbsp;Folder creation does not take place for status &quot;Manufacturing&quot;</p>
