<a name="toc_tc77813"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4617: Verify permission to select Manufacturing status while adding the MD for different users&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify permission to select Manufacturing status while adding the MD for different users</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>User is on MD listing page&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Login as&nbsp;Master user and click on Add icon&nbsp;in MD Listing screen</p>
</td><td><p>Master user&nbsp;is able to select the status &quot;Manufacturuing.)</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Login as&nbsp;CCM user and click on Add icon&nbsp;in MD Listing screen</p>
</td><td><p>CCM is able to select the status &quot;Manufacturuing.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Login as Key&nbsp;user and click on Add icon&nbsp;in MD Listing screen</p>
</td><td><p>Key is able to select the status &quot;Manufacturuing.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td><p>Login as&nbsp;customer user and click on Add icon&nbsp;in MD Listing screen</p>
</td><td><p>Customer user should not be&nbsp;able to select the status &quot;Manufacturuing.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td><p>Login as&nbsp;Distributor user and click on Add icon&nbsp;in MD Listing screen</p>
</td><td><p>Distributor user should not be&nbsp;able to select the status &quot;Manufacturuing.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td><p>Login as&nbsp;Std Conti user and click on Add icon&nbsp;in MD Listing screen</p>
</td><td><p>Std Conti&nbsp;user should not be&nbsp;able to select the status &quot;Manufacturuing.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td><p>Login as&nbsp;Market Manager user and click on Add icon&nbsp;in MD Listing screen</p>
</td><td><p>Market Manager user should not be&nbsp;able to select the status &quot;Manufacturuing.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td><p>Login as&nbsp;Territory Manager user and click on Add icon&nbsp;in MD Listing screen</p>
</td><td><p>Territory Manager user should not be&nbsp;able to select the status &quot;Manufacturuing.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
