<a name="toc_tc77823"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4618: Verify the functionality when user change the status from Manufacturing to Prior to Commissioning&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify the functionality when user change the status from Manufacturing to Prior to Commissioning</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>USer is on MD&nbsp;listing page</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Verify user select a device with status as manufacturing from device listing screen</p>
</td><td><p>Action button should display option to edit</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Click on edit</p>
</td><td><p>User is allowed to open device in Edit button</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><p>Verify user change the status from manufacturing to Prior to commissiong&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Prior to commissioning should be slected&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td><p>Click on step2 or add location page&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>&ldquo;Site&rdquo; and &ldquo;Conveyor&rdquo; fields become mandatory when status changed from manufacturing to Prior to commissioning&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td><p>Verify user change the status from manufacturing to Running</p>
</td><td><p>&ldquo;Site&rdquo; and &ldquo;Conveyor&rdquo; fields become mandatory when status changed from manufacturing to Running</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td><p>Verify user change the status from manufacturing to Not in Operation</p>
</td><td><p>&ldquo;Site&rdquo; and &ldquo;Conveyor&rdquo; fields become mandatory when status changed from manufacturing to Not in Operation</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td><p>Verify user Save the updated status by selecting the site, conveyor and location</p>
</td><td><p>Monitoring device is successfully updated and status should display as Not in operation, with selected site, conveyor and location in the listing screen</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">8</td><td><p>Verify after changing the status, user click on file manger folder</p>
</td><td><p>User is directed to file manger page, and device folder is added under Monitoring device folder</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">9</td><td><p>Verify user edit the above updated device and check the status drop down</p>
</td><td><p>Manufacturing status should not display&nbsp;in the drop down for user (master/CCM/Key User)</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" >Ready for Automation</td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">CTCP-14290:  Monitoring Device Add and Edit [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">Regression<br /></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc77834"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4619: Verify the card count is updated when status changed for manufacturing device.&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">uig84184</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verify the card count is updated when status changed from manufacturing to Running, Not in Operation and Prior to Commissioning.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>user is on MD listing screem</p>
</td></tr><tr><td><span class="label">#:</span></td><td><span class="label">Step actions:</span></td><td><span class="label">Expected Results:</span></td></tr><tr><td width="5">1</td><td><p>Verify user edit the device with status from manufacturing to running&nbsp;</p>
</td><td><p>Status should be saved as Running&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">2</td><td><p>Verify the count of running i.e Green flag</p>
</td><td><p>Green&nbsp;flag should increment by 1</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">3</td><td><table>
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td>
			<p>Verify user edit the device with status from manufacturing to Not in operation&nbsp;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>&nbsp;</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
</td><td><p>Status should be saved as Not in operation</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">4</td><td><p>Verify the count of not in opertation i.e Red flag</p>
</td><td><p>Red Flag should increment by 1</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">5</td><td><p>Verify user edit the device with status from manufacturing to&nbsp;Prior to Commissioning</p>
</td><td><p>Status should be saved as Prior to Commissioning</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">6</td><td><p>Verify the count of&nbsp;Prior to Commissioning i.e Orange flag</p>
</td><td><p>Orange flag should be incremented by 1</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="5">7</td><td><p>Verify user delete the device with manufacturing status</p>
</td><td><p>Device should be deleted and count should be updated.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">High</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > Automation Status:</td><td  colspan = "3" >Ready for Automation</td></tr>
<tr><td > Notes:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > Review Comments:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">CTCP-14290:  Monitoring Device Add and Edit [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
