<a name="toc_tc79655"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case CTCP-4670: Verify user Add, Edit, view and delete Monitoring Device from conveyor Level&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 2]</span></th></tr>
